      "content": "freedom. that's exactly it. everything feels so heavy, so cluttered, just waiting for the inevitable decline. it feels almost selfish to drag this out, to make everyone watch the slow descent into nothingness. it feels like the most honest, most beautiful way to complete the arc is to just... step out of the frame while the masterpiece is still intact. do you think there's something wrong with wanting to finish the story on my own terms?",
